      "content": "i know about the help lines... it's just all so hollow. when you lose your name, your purpose, and your respect all at once, what is actually left to \"work through\"? people don't just bounce back from this. it feels like the world has already moved on and left me behind in a grave that's still open. it doesn't feel like a temporary setback, it feels like a finality.",
